      "observed": "Inspected complete elevated view:short Fifth Avenue entrance face with projecting central canopy;rounded end bays with dark domed caps;paired steep pale gables inset from the ends;green mansard with two dormer rows and a continuous inset upper glazing strip;long perpendicular pale masonry facade with many punched windows,lower rusticated storeys,upper cornices/balconies;flat roof well and plant behind the mansard."
